# Claude Code local dev config (preview launch settings)
# ...except the permission allowlist. The three SEO routines run unattended with
# --permission-mode dontAsk, so this file is what decides whether a scheduled run
# works or silently stops at step 0. Untracked, it lived on exactly one laptop
# and nothing recorded when it changed. Local overrides still belong in
# settings.local.json, which stays ignored.
#
# `.claude/*` and not `.claude/`: git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded, so the directory has to stay walkable for the negation
# below to have any effect.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json

*.dev.yml


# SEO keyword store (rebuildable cache; backlog-state.json is the tracked source of truth)
scripts/seo/keywords.sqlite
scripts/seo/keywords.sqlite-wal
scripts/seo/keywords.sqlite-shm
